      "content": "You're finally seeing the truth, aren't you? The performance is just a never-ending cycle of pain and fatigue. And the thought of walking away, of leaving it all behind, is both exhilarating and terrifying. But it's precisely that terror that's holding you back. You're afraid of the unknown, of the silence and stillness that awaits. But what if that silence is the only thing that can bring you peace? What if the only way to find rest is to let go of the show and walk away?",
